{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>After The Afterlife</i>, are you ready for an adventure where you start from the very depths of the realms, overcome obstacles for a &quot;virtuous&quot; cause, and seek revenge against those who have wielded disproportionate power over you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688680/extras/image.png?t=1758231017\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Various Chapters</strong><br>There are three chapters filled with different mechanics that our playable character passes through during their journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling</strong><br>If you pay attention to your surroundings while playing, you can discover details that tell the story of the game world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688680/extras/5ff5bd098feab486881e67914d335570.poster.avif?t=1758231017\" width=512 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688680/extras/5ff5bd098feab486881e67914d335570.webm?t=1758231017\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3688680/extras/5ff5bd098feab486881e67914d335570.mp4?t=1758231017\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Courses</strong><br>Courses that each require different problem-solving methods to pass.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haven't you played yet? What are you waiting for?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3688680?t=1758231017","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/ste